FUNCTION register()
    IF request.method == 'POST'
        GET username and password from request.form
        CALL user_manager.register(username, password)

        IF registration is successful
            REDIRECT to login page
        ELSE
            RETURN "Username already exists" with status 400
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    RENDER registration.html
END FUNCTION
```

2. |Case|:**set_appointment**
```plaintext
FUNCTION set_appointment(user, appointment)
    IF user not in appointments
        INITIALIZE empty list for appointments of user
    ENDIF
    ADD appointment to appointments[user]
    
    OPEN appointments.txt in append mode
        WRITE user and json.dumps(appointment)
    CLOSE file
    RETURN True
END FUNCTION
```

